          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "X5Fw7",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Direction: single pane (A) with the approval docked over the composer (B). Sidebar waits for slice 2 (threads).",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EiCeM",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Approval is the primary action and uses Ely’s PermissionPrompt (Deny · Always allow · Allow once) docked where the composer sits. “Always allow” adds a session-only rule from Claude’s permission_suggestions (verified: nothing is written to the project). The step row in the transcript carries the outcome afterwards.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O3ENhm",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Keyboard: ⌘↵ allow, esc deny, ↵ send, ⇧↵ newline, ⌘. stop. Keyboard-initiated changes never animate.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "y8dMT0",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Step row: one line; the argument end-truncates (the full input is in the dock). Output clamps to 4 lines + “N more lines”.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "nnYE7",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• MCP tool names render as “server · tool”. Paths in metadata middle-truncate. A missing Bash description omits the line.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Xf97V",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Turn footer shows duration and cost from the result message. Errors render inline with a Restart action; the pill says Stopped.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oZ7UN",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Sizes follow Ely: 13px body at 1.6 leading, 720px reading column, 12px radius bubbles/composer, Ely palette in light and dark.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IUujH",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Break-ui: emoji need the system emoji fallback in GPUI (Pen shows a box). Dock input caps at ~8 lines, then scrolls.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
